              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo musi nyene Yosuwa aca agirana isezerano n’abo bantu aho i Shekemu, aca abaha amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe vy’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
