              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ya magufa ya Yosefu Abisirayeli bari baduganye bayakuye muri Egiputa baca bayahamba i Shekemu, mw’itongo Yakobo yari yaraguze ibiceri vy’ifeza ijana ahaguze na bene Hamori se wa Shekemu. Ryaciye riba iry’uruvyaro rwa Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
